      "hash": "428cf8f879",
      "html": "<div class="s-main"><header class="s-head"><h2>Three habits of a good slide</h2></header><div class="s-body"><ul>
<li data-step="1">Say one thing</li>
<li data-step="2">Show it as plainly as you can</li>
<li data-step="3">Stop before the audience does</li>
</ul></div></div>",
