    {
      "attrs": {},
      "hash": "2bae79c76a",
      "html": "<div class="s-main"><header class="s-head"><h2>How a slide is built</h2></header><div class="s-body"><ol>
<li>Split the file at every line that is only three dashes</li>
<li>Read the comments
<ul>
<li>directives set the slide's options</li>
<li>everything else becomes a speaker note</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Infer the layout from what is left</li>
<li>Render the HTML and highlight the code</li>
</ol></div></div>",
