        "data-count": "3",
      },
      "hash": "fd66d61bd1",
      "html": "<div class="s-main"><header class="s-head"><h2>Two themes and a switch</h2></header><div class="s-cols"><section class="s-col"><h3>Paper</h3><p>A pale mint surface with near-black ink, for rooms with the lights on.</p></section><section class="s-col"><h3>Ink</h3><p>The same palette turned around, for dark rooms and late sessions.</p></section><section class="s-col"><h3>Invert</h3><p>One directive flips a single slide into the other theme.</p></section></div></div>",
