    {
      "attrs": {},
      "hash": "10ce30d2e8",
      "html": "<div class="s-main"><header class="s-head"><h2>One thought at a time</h2></header><div class="s-body"><p>A paragraph can wait its turn.</p><p data-step="1">A line of three spaced dots is a pause.</p><p data-step="2">Everything after it appears on the next step.</p></div></div>",
