      "hash": "8ae4689bc0",
      "html": "<div class="s-main"><header class="s-head"><h2>Sources go in footnotes</h2></header><div class="s-body"><p>The stage is a fixed canvas of 1600 by 900 logical pixels, scaled to fit the window.<sup><a href="#fn-8ae4689bc0-fn-stage" id="fn-8ae4689bc0-fnref-stage" data-footnote-ref="" aria-describedby="footnote-label">1</a></sup></p></div></div>
