<ol>
<li id="fn-8ae4689bc0-fn-stage">
<p>Fixed coordinates are what make zoom, drawing, sticky notes, and print line up exactly. <a href="#fn-8ae4689bc0-fnref-stage" data-footnote-backref="" aria-label="Back to reference 1" class="data-footnote-backref">↩</a></p>
</li>
</ol>
</section>",
