    {
      "attrs": {},
      "hash": "eceac5cd8d",
      "html": "<div class="s-main"><header class="s-head"><h2>Fourteen bullets is too many</h2></header><div class="s-body"><ul>
<li>The first bullet sets up the topic and promises that the rest will be brief</li>
<li>The second bullet adds a qualification that nobody in the room asked for</li>
<li>The third bullet repeats the first one in slightly different words</li>
<li>The fourth bullet introduces an acronym that is never explained again</li>
<li>The fifth bullet is a full sentence that should have been a paragraph</li>
<li>The sixth bullet quotes a statistic without saying where it came from</li>
<li>The seventh bullet is where most of the audience stops reading</li>
<li>The eighth bullet contradicts the second one, but only a little</li>
<li>The ninth bullet lists three examples when one would have done</li>
<li>The tenth bullet was added the night before by someone else</li>
<li>The eleventh bullet refers to a chart that is on a different slide</li>
<li>The twelfth bullet says the same thing as the title of the slide</li>
<li>The thirteenth bullet promises that the next slide will explain everything</li>
<li>The fourteenth bullet is finally the point the slide was trying to make</li>
</ul></div></div>",
      "id": "fourteen-bullets-is-too-many",
      "index": 21,
      "layout": "default",
      "line": 225,
      "notes": "<p>An overflow stress test. Fourteen long bullets do not fit, so the runtime steps the density down until they do.</p>",
      "options": {},
      "steps": 0,
      "title": "Fourteen bullets is too many",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {},
      "hash": "60c9ec5ec7",
      "html": "<div class="s-main"><header class="s-head"><h1>Thank you</h1></header><div class="s-body"><p>Edit this deck in decks/demo/deck.md and save. The open deck updates in place.</p></div></div>",
      "id": "thank-you",
